SCIENTIFIC ATTRIBUTION

The crystallographic covalent-radius constants are attributed to:
B. Cordero et al., "Covalent radii revisited", Dalton Transactions (2008),
DOI 10.1039/B801115J. Only numerical scientific constants are used; article
text, tables, figures, and software were not copied.

No Zeo++, Voro++, ASE, CrystalExplorer, or pymatgen algorithm source is copied,
linked, or vendored by PHGG. Those projects and methods are cited in the
provenance document only to distinguish established aliases from this
independent implementation and its deliberately approximate treatments.
